  "title": "FROM STATE INTEGRALS TO q-SERIES",
  "authors_raw": "STAVROS GAROUFALIDIS AND RINAT KASHAEV",
  "title_lines": [
   "FROM STATE INTEGRALS TO q-SERIES"
  ],
  "abstract": "It is well-known to the experts that multi-dimensional state integrals of prod- ucts of Faddeev\u2019s quantum dilogarithm which arise in Quantum Topology can be written as \ufb01nite sums of products of basic hypergeometric series in q = e2\u03c0i\u03c4 and \u02dcq = e\u22122\u03c0i/\u03c4. We illustrate this fact by giving a detailed proof for a family of one-dimensional integrals which includes state-integral invariants of 41 and 52 knots.",
  "docinfo": {
